OL,3,GNEWSARail boss 'confident' in winter
OL,4,Aweather safeguards
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Network Rail boss has said he is
OL,7,F"really confident" safeguards will
OL,8,Fprotect key rail routes in winter after
OL,9,Fmillions of pounds of investment.
OL,11,FKey rail routes in the North West have
OL,12,Fbeen upgraded ahead of stormy weather
OL,13,Fpatterns caused by the climate
OL,14,Fphenomenon El Nino.
OL,16,FNorth West Network Rail has invested
OL,17,F#41m in schemes across the region,
OL,18,Fincluding improvements to the routes
OL,19,Fbetween Settle and Carlisle, between
OL,20,FSheffield and Manchester, and at Shap
OL,21,Fon Cumbria's West Coast Main Line.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
