OL,3,GNEWSARail boss 'confident' in winter
OL,4,Aweather safeguards
OL,5,
OL,6,FArea director for Lancashire and
OL,7,FCumbria, Darren Miller, said: "It's
OL,8,Freally dificult to second-guess the
OL,9,Fweather and we're no stranger to storms
OL,10,Fin Cumbria, but we are always thinking
OL,11,Fthree months ahead."
